module j3.math — Gameplay math is f32. `float` (f64) is not used here.

fn: sqrt sin cos tan asin acos atan atan2 floor ceil abs exp log10 absi wrapi min max mini maxi
    clamp clampi lerp sign vec3FromVec4f
const: PI TAU
struct Mat4: m identity() mul() perspective() lookAt() ortho() affineInverse() inverseAffine()
    transformPoint() translate() scale() rotate()
struct Quat: x y z w identity() xyzw() fromAxisAngle() mul() length() normalize() rotate() toMat4()
struct Vec2: x y new() operator+() operator-() operator*() operator==() length() scale() dot()
    normalize() rotate() fromAngle()
struct Vec3: x y z toVec4f() operator+() operator-() operator*() length() dot() cross() normalize()
    xy() xyz() zero() up()

signatures and comments: `j3c doc j3.math`; one name: `j3c doc j3.math <name>`
